OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill mostly die out this evening. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be mainly
OL,8,Fdry but still the odd shower across
OL,9,Fwestern Tayside.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,12,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,13,Fafternoon with a few light showers
OL,14,Facross the west and north. Staying dry
OL,15,Felsewhere. Drier, brighter again in
OL,16,Fthe evening.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,19,Fbright on Sunday. Becoming unsettled
OL,20,Fon Monday and Tuesday, perhaps heavy
OL,21,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
